  "implementation": [
    "Passive relative import of actual pinned derive provider; no new helper, package init or copied provider-loader implementation.",
    "Exact current .11 admission refuses PENDING before context, copying and serialization. Public version/type dispatch and required dictionary plan guards precede provider work.",
    "Builtin-only iterative object preflight conservatively charges repeated aliases, containers, names, escaped strings and aggregate contract/plan framing before hashing or deepcopy; rejects cycles, hostile subclasses, nonfinite numbers, lone surrogates, excessive depth/nodes and oversized integers.",
    "A single charged Session cache covers actual program roles, current fragments, all six held inputs and full raw execution. Canonical root reads enforce per-file and cumulative limits; callbacks are explicit byte claims rather than physical provenance.",
    "All797 records/1594 typed nodes, complete graph and current source scheduling metadata, child caps/families/dependencies, old records and every current fragment binding are validated before exact inverse restoration.",
    "Current C99 generator hash comes from supplied actual current source bytes and can vary. Whole .10/.9/.8 canonical plan pins enforce full historical records, root metadata, waves, old pointers and explicit old C99 source hashes.",
    "All six held pins and full55 history/current execution remain required; scoped test seals never modify the immutable old provider policy or global implementations."
  ],
  "whole_restored_plan_sha256": {
    "1.0.10": "178f531b9680072ad1de1b910bce39682377d3ee7e7be899e0c93ed48e728be3",
